<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Joseph Jenkins Roberts</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1809">1809</a>–<a href="/years/1876">1876</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Joseph Jenkins Roberts was a free-born African American merchant from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/virginia">Virginia</a> who emigrated to Liberia in 1829. He became the first Black governor of the Commonwealth of Liberia in 1841 and, after independence was declared on 26 July 1847, the republic's first president. He served again as president from 1872 to 1876.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/joseph-jenkins-roberts.jpg" alt="Joseph Jenkins Roberts" width="320" height="448" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: not stated · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Joseph_Jenkins_Roberts_c._1865_(A)_(cropped).tif" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote><b>Joseph Jenkins Roberts</b>, a merchant born in Virginia, became the first president.</blockquote><a href="/empire/liberia">Liberia · Foundation</a></li><li><blockquote><b>Joseph Jenkins Roberts</b>, born free in Virginia, was inaugurated as president of the newly independent Republic of Liberia.</blockquote><a href="/today-in-history/january-3">3 January in history</a></li><li><blockquote><b>Joseph Jenkins Roberts</b> became the first Black governor in 1841.</blockquote><a href="/state/colony-of-liberia">Colony of Liberia</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Norfolk, in what is now <a href="/countries/united-states">the United States</a>. Died in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/monrovia">Monrovia</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/liberia">Liberia</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=36.85,-76.29&amp;year=1852" aria-label="Norfolk on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="2636 836 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Joseph Jenkins Roberts"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M3086 1106h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M3086 1106h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=36.85,-76.29&amp;year=1852">What was here in 1852? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
